pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: $white
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 15, 880, 41]
    content:
      style: $title
      align: [left, middle]
      text: '<p><span style="font-size: 26px;"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, Roboto, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, sans-serif;">JSBridge 能力</span></span></span></span></p>'
  - elementId: accent-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 52, 50, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
  - elementId: api-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 65, 430, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: $primary
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: JSBridge 提供的核心 API
  - elementId: api1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 94, 430, 45]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:monospace; color:$accent;">chat.sendMessage({ target: 'embed', text })</span></p>
        <p>回填 + 直接发送，触发 AI 响应</p>
  - elementId: api2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 146, 430, 45]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:monospace; color:$accent;">chat.fillComposer({ target: 'embed', text })</span></p>
        <p>回填输入框，不自动发送，等用户确认</p>
  - elementId: api3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 198, 430, 45]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:monospace; color:$accent;">chat.togglePanel() / ui.openDrawer()</span></p>
        <p>开关右栏 AI 面板 / 打开 AI 抽屉</p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [490, 65, 1, 185]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $border}
  - elementId: cap-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 65, 410, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: $primary
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 业务页面因此具备的能力
  - elementId: cap1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [510, 96, 16, 16]
    iconName: fas:bolt
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
  - elementId: cap1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [534, 94, 380, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>一键唤起 AI</strong></p>
        <p>页面放个"问 AI"按钮，点击直接打开右栏并触发对话</p>
  - elementId: cap2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [510, 142, 16, 16]
    iconName: fas:upload
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
  - elementId: cap2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [534, 140, 380, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>选中数据推给 AI</strong></p>
        <p>表格里选中一行，点"分析"，AI 自动拿到上下文处理</p>
  - elementId: cap3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [510, 188, 16, 16]
    iconName: fas:wand-magic-sparkles
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
  - elementId: cap3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [534, 186, 380, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>表单智能辅助</strong></p>
        <p>用户填到一半，AI 根据上下文自动补全或校验建议</p>
  - elementId: img1
    elementType: image
    bounds: [40, 270, 280, 120]
    src: media/quote-main.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: $border}
  - elementId: img2
    elementType: image
    bounds: [340, 270, 280, 120]
    src: media/quote-process.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: $border}
  - elementId: img3
    elementType: image
    bounds: [640, 270, 280, 120]
    src: media/quote-result.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: $border}
  - elementId: img-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 395, 880, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: $muted
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 报价工作台已验证：打开页面 → 上传 Excel → AI 五步处理 → 确认保存
  - elementId: cost-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 425, 880, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $border}
  - elementId: cost-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 435, 880, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: $primary
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>接入成本：业务方自建 2-3 人月 → 调几个 JSBridge API，几小时完成</p>
